   "title": "「さかた夏の縁日まつり」が今週末開催！ 甚句に屋台にフェスなど夏の楽しさてんこ盛り！",
   "html": "\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph\">今週末<strong>8/7(金)・8/8(土)</strong>に<br><strong><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-l\"><span class=\"swl-marker mark_green\">「さかた夏の縁日まつり」</span></span></strong>が開催されます！</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"684\" src=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07537_copy_1616x1080-1024x684.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-87429\" srcset=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07537_copy_1616x1080-1024x684.jpg 1024w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07537_copy_1616x1080-300x200.jpg 300w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07537_copy_1616x1080-768x513.jpg 768w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07537_copy_1616x1080-1536x1027.jpg 1536w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07537_copy_1616x1080.jpg 1616w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">中通りと中央公園に屋台が並ぶぞ</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-icon_info wp-block-paragraph\">甚句流しから「さかた夏の縁日まつり」に変わって今年で5年目。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">今のところ週間天気予報では概ね良好なコンディションの様子…！<br>賑やかな酒田の宵に、どうぞ涼しいコーデでお越しください！</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"swell-block-postLink\">\t\t\t<div class=\"p-blogCard -external\" data-type=\"type3\" data-onclick=\"clickLink\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"p-blogCard__inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"p-blogCard__caption\">酒田さんぽ</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"p-blogCard__thumb c-postThumb\"><figure class=\"c-postThumb__figure\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"//sakata-kankou.com/image/rendering/attraction_image/14177/keep/1200?v=f8fd9e8146dd0c7fece51a8920c30aefc2359bc9\" alt=\"\" class=\"c-postThumb__img u-obf-cover\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\"></figure></div>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"p-blogCard__body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"p-blogCard__title\" href=\"https://sakata-kankou.com/event/30730\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">さかた夏の縁日まつり</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"p-blogCard__excerpt\">「さかた夏の縁日まつり」の情報は「酒田さんぽ」で。名称を「さかた夏の縁日まつり」にかえ開催して5年目。今年も2日間で開催します。開催にあたり、たくさんの企業様より&#8230;</span>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">イベント概要はこんな感じ↓</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-big_icon_point wp-block-paragraph\"><span class=\"swl-fz u-fz-l\">さかた夏の縁日まつり</span><br>（雨天決行・来場無料）<br><br>【時　間】<br>8月7日(金)<br>17:30～18:00　浜田小学校 地域伝統芸能公演<br>17:30～20:45　ビヤガーデン<br>18:00～20:45　ビヤガーデン（中通り）<br>18:00～18:50　酒田の盆踊り2026<br>19:00～20:45　酒田甚句踊り＆S-Jinku<br><br>8月8日(土)<br>11:00～　こども縁日あそびコーナー（景品なくなり次第終了）<br>11:00～16:00　はたらく車大集合<br>11:00～20:45　縁日屋台大集合<br>15:30～20:00　ミュージックフェス（中央公園）<br>15:30～20:45　ビヤガーデン（中央公園）　<br><br>【内　容】<br>盆踊り・甚句踊り、神輿くねり（8/8のみ）、伝統芸能、ミュージックフェス、ビアガーデン、こども縁日、はたらく車展示など<br><br>【駐車場】<br>なし（近隣駐車場を利用）<strong><br></strong><br>【主催】<br>さかた夏の縁日まつり実行委員会</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">イベントチラシはこんな感じ↓</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"724\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bf7cd663bbb6c7328b2647a60308abe524c74272_page-0001-724x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-87438\" srcset=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bf7cd663bbb6c7328b2647a60308abe524c74272_page-0001-724x1024.jpg 724w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bf7cd663bbb6c7328b2647a60308abe524c74272_page-0001-212x300.jpg 212w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bf7cd663bbb6c7328b2647a60308abe524c74272_page-0001-768x1086.jpg 768w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bf7cd663bbb6c7328b2647a60308abe524c74272_page-0001-1086x1536.jpg 1086w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/bf7cd663bbb6c7328b2647a60308abe524c74272_page-0001.jpg 1240w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 724px) 100vw, 724px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">出典：酒田観光物産協会</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">会場マップはこんな感じ↓</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"524\" src=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/0538a5440616c8f1f5a50766d2e5da75fb59a195_page-0002-1024x524.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-87441\" srcset=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/0538a5440616c8f1f5a50766d2e5da75fb59a195_page-0002-1024x524.png 1024w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/0538a5440616c8f1f5a50766d2e5da75fb59a195_page-0002-300x154.png 300w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/0538a5440616c8f1f5a50766d2e5da75fb59a195_page-0002-768x393.png 768w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/0538a5440616c8f1f5a50766d2e5da75fb59a195_page-0002.png 1113w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">出典：酒田観光物産協会</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">8/7(金)17時からは大通りが車両通行止めに！<br>18時から「酒田の盆踊り2026」、19時からは「酒田甚句踊り＆S-Jinku」がスタート！</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-87452\" srcset=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2.jpeg 1024w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2-768x512.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">大通りが踊りと熱気に包まれます！<br>画像提供：一般社団法人酒田観光物産協会</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">また、屋台飯をつまみながらの宵涼みにぴったりなビアガーデンに、ミュージックフェスなど大人が楽しめるものはもちろん…</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"684\" src=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07543_copy_1616x1080-1024x684.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-87445\" srcset=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07543_copy_1616x1080-1024x684.jpg 1024w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07543_copy_1616x1080-300x200.jpg 300w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07543_copy_1616x1080-768x513.jpg 768w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07543_copy_1616x1080-1536x1027.jpg 1536w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07543_copy_1616x1080.jpg 1616w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">昨年の様子</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"684\" src=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07526_copy_1616x1080-1024x684.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-87455\" srcset=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07526_copy_1616x1080-1024x684.jpg 1024w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07526_copy_1616x1080-300x200.jpg 300w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07526_copy_1616x1080-768x513.jpg 768w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07526_copy_1616x1080-1536x1027.jpg 1536w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07526_copy_1616x1080.jpg 1616w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">昨年の様子</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">8日は消防車やパトカーなど、地元のはたらく車の展示も！<br>乗り物好きなちびっこはぜひチェック！</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"684\" src=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07530_copy_1616x1080-1024x684.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-87454\" srcset=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07530_copy_1616x1080-1024x684.jpg 1024w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07530_copy_1616x1080-300x200.jpg 300w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07530_copy_1616x1080-768x513.jpg 768w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07530_copy_1616x1080-1536x1027.jpg 1536w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07530_copy_1616x1080.jpg 1616w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"684\" src=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07527_copy_1616x1080-1024x684.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-87447\" srcset=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07527_copy_1616x1080-1024x684.jpg 1024w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07527_copy_1616x1080-300x200.jpg 300w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07527_copy_1616x1080-768x513.jpg 768w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07527_copy_1616x1080-1536x1027.jpg 1536w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/DSC07527_copy_1616x1080.jpg 1616w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-big_icon_point wp-block-paragraph\">さらに8日は100円で遊べるこども縁日あそびコーナーを開催！<br>お菓子がもらえるのでぜひ挑戦してみてね～。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">今年も夏の楽しさいっぱいの<strong><span class=\"swl-marker mark_yellow\">「さかた夏の縁日まつり」</span></strong>、ぜひお誘い合わせの上お越しくださいね！</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-87453\" srcset=\"https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2-1.jpeg 1024w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2-1-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://shonai2.fun/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2-1-768x512.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">画像提供：一般社団法人酒田観光物産協会</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-style-big_icon_caution wp-block-paragraph\">なおイベントの開催に伴いは大通りは8/7、中通りは8/7・8/8の両日車両通行止めが発生するので、車で酒田市中心街を通る際は何卒ご注意を！</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"swl-marker mark_yellow\">ハシゴのタカさん、キングたくさん<br>情報提供ありがとうございました</span></strong></p>\n\n\n<section class=\"none-rss\">\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group u-mb-ctrl u-mb-20\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained